": \"Did not approach debugging issues\", \"score\": 0}], \"final_feedback\": \"Candidate struggled to answer fundamental questions about Python, indicating significant knowledge gaps. Needs improvement in understanding and applying basic concepts.\", \"overall_score\": 9, \"total_marks\": 70}', '2025-12-24 15:26:40.225322');

